{"steam_appid":2797960,"steam_name":"Confidential Killings - A Detective Game","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2797960/66541958/f78b27c0f830f2e8428a4e1be38fa9fcc6608dba/1768203953/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768222534","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257263405/84f5d1840bc5facb0a63042fd29069cb97916429/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768222534","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/bd7ddb34a1e3001443b39c944de30ebb59587e0d/ss_bd7ddb34a1e3001443b39c944de30ebb59587e0d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780189664","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/3ad92bd808e4b9eb72f012002a2ebeafd6f6bb3d/ss_3ad92bd808e4b9eb72f012002a2ebeafd6f6bb3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780189664","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/5106a7e02ca60884d539be62480983832c84f78d/ss_5106a7e02ca60884d539be62480983832c84f78d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780189664","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/6ba2f007709f6f4e45a21764ea68df1576d4f52b/ss_6ba2f007709f6f4e45a21764ea68df1576d4f52b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780189664","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/70d967800d088c5ec2594bd810fc943578b5029f/ss_70d967800d088c5ec2594bd810fc943578b5029f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780189664"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/be55f4eea797c732aacde79351254c1d.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/be55f4eea797c732aacde79351254c1d.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRITTY, MATURE STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actors, writers, producers, are getting murdered one by one in cold blood. No one is safe. Who is pulling the strings behind these apparently unrelated murders?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VARIED AND REALISTIC CAST </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-dealing, backstabbing, betrayal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems in the world of stars. Take a peek behind the curtains, learn what's going on behind the glistering façade. Meet a varied cast of characters, discover their secrets and ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful... they may end up in a body bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/ba754bacb46c96faaba9492473dab15d.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/ba754bacb46c96faaba9492473dab15d.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEDUCTIVE GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine the crime scene, find clues, piece together what happened, find the culprit! Reveal what's the true reason behind these <strong>Confidential Killings</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1a4f578a6ebd4ac559d3bf9653d89b64.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1a4f578a6ebd4ac559d3bf9653d89b64.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1a4f578a6ebd4ac559d3bf9653d89b64.mp4?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (2nd Gen or newer) or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["BRANE","Lorenzo Boni"],"publishers":["Surefire.Games"],"release_date":"12 Jan, 2026"}